# Dance Dance Revolution 4th Mix Plus (G*A34 VER. JAA): a game, from what ddr4mp-install.his left
# (the flash and the PC Card installed; the game cassette in). The first boot says the RTC RAM was
# cleared (NOTE 605): Test goes on; the title is at frame ~7,800. Two coins at the title, Start
# twice; the selects time out to their defaults; the song played by stepping on all four panels
# every 8 frames. Hashes the main RAM every frame, snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game ddr4mp

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 900 press "Service Mode" 8
at 7900 press "Coin 1" 8
at 7940 press "Coin 1" 8
at 8100 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 8300 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 10600 every 8 press "P1 Left" 4
from 10600 every 8 press "P1 Down" 4
from 10600 every 8 press "P1 Up" 4
from 10600 every 8 press "P1 Right" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 19600 quit
